<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/paperwork-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" width="1024" height="512" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.08"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/appraisal-workbench/">Workbench</a></li><li>RCV/ACV Holdback Calculator</li></ol></nav><p class="tag">Free calculator · runs in your browser</p><h1>RCV vs ACV Calculator for Depreciation and Holdback</h1><p class="lede">Replacement-cost policies usually pay twice: an actual-cash-value check now and the held-back depreciation once repairs are finished. List your damaged items to see how the money splits.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="wrap">
<div class="tool tool-wide" data-tool="dep">
  <div class="tool-head"><span>RCV / ACV holdback calculator</span><i>Add a row per damaged item</i></div>
